menuconfig MODULES_MOTOR_RIG_TEST
	bool "motor_rig_test"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for motor_rig_test

		Standalone, manually-started bench/ground-test tool that spins any
		combination of this quad's 4 motors, each at its own independently
		set thrust value (MRIGT_MOTORS bitmask selects the motors,
		MRIGT_M1_THR..MRIGT_M4_THR the per-motor values), through the same
		actuator_test override path as the `actuator_test` command. Only
		ever applies while disarmed - refuses to command anything if the
		vehicle is armed. Remove propellers before use. Start with
		`motor_rig_test start` and stop with `motor_rig_test stop` or by
		clearing MRIGT_MOTORS to 0.
